# Local Aid Management System (LAMS)

Local Aid Management System (LAMS) is a web-based platform connecting users with verified local service providers for jobs like plumbing, babysitting, and electrical work.

---

## 📖 Documentation

For detailed setup instructions, guides, and tutorials, visit our [Wiki](https://github.com/Abhinav4477/LAMS/wiki).

---

## Features

- Authentication & Authorization
- Service Management
- Job Handling and Tracking
- Service Provider Availability & Scheduling
- Payment and Transaction Management
- Data Configuration and Administration
